-- ind-a-tests-disagree.l4: assertions of ind-a that FAIL against the encoding, where I believe the encoding (not the source) is at fault.
-- Each assertion states MY expected answer (WORK/ind-a/expectations.md); none has been edited to match the code.
-- EXPECTED FAILING ASSERTIONS IN THIS FILE: 2.

§ `ind-a: assertions that disagree with the encoding`

-- DIS-1 (SC-03; C1; src:878-879, R&O.17/2018 Art 1(a)). Article 11 (Part 4) came into force on 1 May 2018. An application lodged on 30 April 2018 is not one the Commissioner
-- must register under Article 11(4), however complete it is. G4's exported duty does not read the day: it answers "must register".
`ind-a dis K` MEANS
    `Interpretation of Articles 11 and 12` WITH
        `how the twelve months preceding the application are counted` IS `the twelve months ending on the day before the application`
        `which day is the date of the application` IS `the day the application is lodged`
        `what an application that does not comply leads to` IS `no duty to register or to refuse arises while the application does not comply`
        `how the duty to register meets the bars on granting the application` IS `a bar on granting the application displaces the duty to register`
        `whether a formerly registered charity is another registered charity` IS `a formerly registered charity is not another registered charity`
        `how a year is taken back from 29 February` IS `a year before 29 February is 28 February`
        `which names of another registered charity Article 12(1)(a) compares` IS `its registered name and its alternative registered names`
        `whether a previous registered name is still one of its registered names` IS `a previous registered name is not one of its registered names`
        `how the period for the Commissioner's decision is counted` IS `the period starts the day after the date of the application`
        `how reasonable time and as soon as practicable are read for the guidance` IS `as a determination the caller supplies`
        `which payees Article 11(2)(e)(ii) reaches` IS `a payee who was a governor when the payment was made`
        `how applies or should be applied is read in Article 11(4)(f)` IS `a ground of mandatory refusal applies, or a ground of discretionary refusal should be applied`

`ind-a dis info` MEANS `Information on a matter under Article 11(2)(a)` WITH `provided as at the time of the application` IS TRUE, `would differ once the entity is registered` IS FALSE, `provided as proposed once the entity is registered` IS FALSE

`ind-a application lodged 2018-04-30` MEANS
    `Application for registration` WITH
        dates IS `Dates of an application` WITH `date lodged` IS YMD 2018 4 30, `date on which it became complete` IS JUST (YMD 2018 4 30)
        `particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` IS `Particulars under Article 11(2)(a)` WITH
            `how the applicant meets Article 11(4)(c) and (d)` IS `ind-a dis info`
            `matters under Article 8(3)(a), (b) and (d)` IS `ind-a dis info`
            `matters under Article 8(3)(h), (i), (m) and (n) apply to the applicant` IS FALSE
            `matters under Article 8(3)(h), (i), (m) and (n)` IS `ind-a dis info`
        `documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` IS `Documents under Article 11(2)(b) to (d)` WITH
            `copy of the applicant's constitution` IS TRUE
            `draft of the proposed statement of registered charitable purposes` IS TRUE
            `draft of the registered public benefit statement` IS TRUE
        `financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` IS `Financial details under Article 11(2)(e)` WITH
            `most recent financial accounts exist` IS FALSE
            `details of the most recent financial accounts` IS FALSE
            `payments made to governors` IS EMPTY
            `payments to governors disclosed in the application` IS EMPTY
            `draft of the proposed statement under an Order under Article 13(9)(b)` IS FALSE
            `Non-Profit Organizations (Jersey) Law 2008 would require other financial information` IS FALSE
            `other financial information required under that Law` IS FALSE
            `entry in the restricted section is requested` IS FALSE
            `Order prescribes further financial information` IS FALSE
            `further financial information prescribed by Order` IS FALSE
        `other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` IS `Other requirements under Article 11(2)(f)` WITH
            `Regulations under Article 11(3) require other information, documents or evidence` IS FALSE
            `other information, documents and evidence required by Regulations` IS FALSE
            `procedure under Regulations under Article 11(3)(b) followed` IS TRUE
            `Commissioner has requested other information, documents or evidence to determine the application` IS FALSE
            `other information, documents and evidence requested by the Commissioner` IS FALSE
        `provisions of Article 11(2) that an Order disapplies for this applicant` IS EMPTY

`ind-a dis findings` MEANS
    `Findings of the Commissioner for Article 11(4)` WITH
        `applicant will meet the charity test on registration` IS FALSE
        `constitution of the applicant is a written document` IS TRUE
        `applicant carries out, or intends to carry out, an activity in or from within Jersey` IS FALSE
        `activity is, in the opinion of the Commissioner, substantial` IS FALSE
        `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application must be refused applies` IS FALSE
        `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused has its circumstances present` IS FALSE
        `a ground prescribed under Article 11(7) on which the application may be refused should be applied` IS FALSE

#ASSERT NOT (`Art 11 the duty of the Commissioner on the application` `ind-a dis K` `ind-a application lodged 2018-04-30` FALSE TRUE (`ind-a entity` "Hope Jersey" `an applicant for registration` (LIST `a company`) TRUE (LIST `ind-a Jersey resident individual`) (LIST `ind-a relief of poverty purpose`)) TRUE `ind-a dis findings` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `the Commissioner must register the applicant`)

-- DIS-2 (S8.3j-01; C8; src:234, src:392-393). Which year is "the most recent year" is not defined by the Law: the year of an annual return and its timing are left to an Order
-- under Article 13(7) and (8). Expected: the encoding cannot answer whether the return "for the most recent year" was sent without being told the year (an input), so it should refuse.
-- The encoding (F3.2 and F3.7 defaults) assumes the calendar year that ended last and answers.
`ind-a dis R` MEANS `Interpretation of Articles 8 to 10` WITH
    `start of the ten years of retention` IS `from the day the Commissioner receives or makes each copy`
    `meaning of the year of an annual return` IS `the calendar year`
    `reach of Article 10(4)` IS `a registered charity is an entity entered in the general or the restricted section only`
    `counting the day of an event in a period of years` IS `the day of the event is not counted, so the last day of the period is the anniversary`
    `adding a year to a date that does not exist` IS `the date moves back to the last day of the month`
    `day on which an entry takes effect` IS `on the day of the entry`
    `the most recent year` IS `the latest year that has ended before the day asked`
    `required steps notices noted` IS `every notice that has been served`
    `entities within Article 8(4)(a)` IS `an entity that its constitutional Law requires to have a registered office or business address in Jersey`
    `main premises that are a private dwelling house` IS `Article 8(4)(b) does not apply, so Article 8(4)(c) is reached`
    `section that decides Article 8(5)(b)` IS `the section the entity was entered in immediately before deregistration`
    `who must meet a condition under Article 9(2)` IS `whoever makes the request, an applicant for registration or a registered charity`
    `reach of Article 8(3)(a) to sub-paragraph (ba)` IS `Article 8(3)(a) reaches only the sub-paragraphs it names`

`ind-a dis charity` MEANS
    `Registered charity` WITH
        entity IS `ind-a entity` "Hope Jersey" `entered in the general section` (LIST `a company`) TRUE (LIST `ind-a Jersey resident individual`) (LIST `ind-a relief of poverty purpose`)
        `registration number` IS "JC-0042"
        `registered name` IS "Hope Jersey"
        `alternative registered names` IS EMPTY
        `date registered` IS YMD 2019 3 1
        `date deregistered` IS NOTHING
        `registered charitable purposes` IS LIST "the prevention or relief of poverty"
        `registered public benefit statement` IS "relief of poverty in Jersey by a food bank"
        `is an organized religious charity` IS FALSE

#ASSERT REFUSED `Art 8(3)(j) the registered charity has sent its annual return for the most recent year` `ind-a dis R` `ind-a dis charity` (YMD 2026 10 27) (`Facts for the annual return entry (Article 8(3)(j))` WITH `a date on which the charity's financial year ends` IS NOTHING, `annual returns sent` IS LIST (`Annual return sent by a charity (Article 8(3)(j))` WITH `last day of the year to which it relates` IS YMD 2025 12 31, `date sent` IS YMD 2026 3 1))
